@rickhanlonii would be nice if we could unify the stream configs for flight and fizz. unless there are different limitations in the host where these packages run I think we could just adopt the impls from the Flight config.

The practical consideration is that in a later PR aborting will start to have an async gap if scheduleWork is in fact task-y like it is in Flight.

Ideally we'd get away from these ever being sync. the main reason they need to be is for renderToString.

